- `crates/vox-code-audit/src/detectors/auth_endpoint.rs`: Add new detector for auth endpoints missing decorators, identifying `@endpoint` functions in Vox files that lack `@auth(...)` or `@public`.
- `crates/vox-code-audit/src/detectors/mod.rs`: Register the 5 new detectors in the `all_rules` function and add module declarations.

